    "limitations": "The model uses the published 85 m sculpture height including the sword and a roughly 2 m exposed plinth. The figure proportions, hand pose, folds and sword openings are reconstructed from photographs. The named map point and mapped plinth fix placement. The geotagged hilltop view confirms the signed east-southeast face. Standard Terrarium supplies the summit datum and the apron grades. The compact apron transitions to coarse surrounding terrain and leaves the mapped paths in place. The rest of the memorial complex is outside this asset. Physical-device timings remain unmeasured."
